  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To further the Business Development work of the CLV Cluster in 3 areas: Marketing materials; Innovation labs for concepts for donors and;  Research compendia.
&#x2022; Main activities
1. Develop a set of offline and online marketing materials for the CLV
i. For example slide decks, infographics, video clips from current video footage from Cambodia, Laos and Vietnam across the CLV strategic areas (civic space, gender justice and natural resource management), animations (just short for social media use), flyers, banners etc.
2. Three writing/innovation labs to develop and write up CLV BD concepts.
i. One lab will be held in each of Cambodia, Laos and Vietnam in Feb 2023. Labs will work on concepts for transboundary projects and be on a CLV strategic theme.
3. A set of research compendia
i.one for each strategic area of the CLV (civic space, gender justice and natural resource management), these will include current research produced by each country.
ii. Plus optional extra if time/ resources permits: onepiece of new research/writing looking at thestrategic area from a CLV perspective. (This would probably take the form of an updated literature review and/or update / refresh of a current piece of research</narrative>
  </description>
